sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as UI Frontend
  participant TI as Taxes Inquiry
  participant S3 as S3 Tax Files
  participant DB as Aurora
  participant EB as EventBridge
  participant L1 as Lambda NewFileUploaded
  participant K as Kafka ARBO TaxFile
  participant SU as S3 Signed URL Service
  participant FBC as FB Outbound Connector
  participant FB as Frame Banking
  participant PC as Partner Callback
  participant N as Notification
  FE->>TI: Get S3 Presigned URL for upload
  TI-->>FE: URL prefirmada
  FE->>S3: PUT archivo
  S3->>EB: New File Uploaded Event
  EB->>L1: Start Lambda
  L1->>K: Publish Uploaded File MetaData
  K->>TI: Consume NewFile message
  TI->>DB: Insert metadata (InProgress)
  TI->>EB: Create Scheduler (now + 5min)
  TI->>SU: Get S3 Signed URL
  SU-->>TI: URL firmada de descarga
  TI->>FBC: Invoke Uploaded File Notification API
  FBC->>FB: Invoke Uploaded File Notification API
  FB-->>FBC: Ack
  TI->>DB: Update status (URLSent)
  FB->>S3: Descarga con URL firmada (solo en la arquitectura)
  FB->>PC: Download Async Response (callback)
  PC->>K: Publish Callback message
  K->>TI: Consume Callback message
  TI->>DB: Update status (CallbackReceived)
  TI->>S3: Delete File
  TI->>DB: Update status (FileDeleted)
  TI->>N: Email: File Successfully Imported by FB
  TI->>EB: Delete FileID Scheduler
